5,000.00, planned at 150,000.00 (range ~110,000-200,000). Worst-case fee swing if C.3 shifted both sides' fees (~300,000 total) requires us to assert and lose weak claims; the tort count is abandoned and the invoice core is conceded, so that tail is largely foreclosed by our own pleading discipline.",
